<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.893 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.893 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.893 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.889 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    December 31	  December 30</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.893		  1.889</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2,33 million	    $0,74 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
